Subject: Which team owns what — routing guide
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

Quick routing guide so requests stop bouncing:

- People / PTO / hiring / performance: People Operations (hr@company.internal)
- Pay, expenses, vendors, purchase orders: Finance Operations
- Laptops, accounts, MFA, software access: IT Helpdesk
- Customer contracts and NDAs: Legal
- Office access badges and visitors: Workplace / Facilities

If a request spans two teams, open the ticket with the primary owner and CC the second. Do not create duplicate tickets.

Morgan Hale
Chief of Staff
